{"signature": "572a02d153ca67de6600ebe06820ee1e1892af15074bf66dcaa0462b961b8e24", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "github", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests", "field": "author_login", "values": ["PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/10", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#19", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 19, "title": "Added anim sequence on combo changed", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Enhanced visual combo sequences that chain effects across tiles with stepped highlights.\n  * External tile dim control allowing tiles to be programmatically dimmed or restored.\n  * Dynamic effect scaling for more impactful visuals.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * More consistent combo update handling to reduce redundant or missed visual updates.\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "7aa6ebcb37041e09af60366e4078d10c30a6386a", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/comboChangedSeq", "head_sha": "e6df90785ada4de065c507916c5889081b9de225", "additions": 69, "deletions": 11, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-12-30T18:17:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-30T19:56:18Z", "merged_at": "2025-12-30T19:56:15Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-30T19:56:15Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/12", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#20", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 20, "title": "Debug Level Loader", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "- Moved all level definitions to Resources folder to load them from script.\r\n- Added debug function to load all available levels and play them from there\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added \"Load Level\" option to the cheat menu for dynamic level selection during development.\n  * Integrated UI for browsing and loading available levels with seamless navigation back to the main menu.\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "29a6b9be93a2b0e71fffdd7be784b85e001b3538", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/debugLevelLoader", "head_sha": "ced77eeeaf514f9fbd5b28550ab4e81462050bd7", "additions": 351, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 111, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:21:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-31T22:08:41Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-12-31T22:08:28Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/13", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#21", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 21, "title": "Debug Level Loader", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Added Level Loader to cheat menu without moving level definition files\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Level loading functionality now available in development build cheats\n  * Test levels are now supported for development and testing purposes\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "a934cf1bbe23c06425a32dcc38d02876f7a06f0d", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/debugLevelLoader", "head_sha": "32c1d89eac7f3e8100fbb1034841541837d955b6", "additions": 350, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-12-31T22:16:16Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-02T09:49:29Z", "merged_at": "2026-01-02T09:49:24Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-02T09:49:24Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/16", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#24", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 24, "title": "AppLovinMAX integration and Rewarded Ads", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "ca738d3133433b1c383fd4ee501c652a15a45a14", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ads", "head_sha": "7b3514665635cb71fa37e76c0490a7090ea35eb8", "additions": 33284, "deletions": 96, "changed_files": 274, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2026-01-10T03:15:26Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-13T20:14:53Z", "merged_at": "2026-01-13T20:14:50Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-13T20:14:50Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/18", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#26", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 26, "title": "Added cooldown to main menu upgrade ad watch", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a cooldown system for upgrade ads that prevents watching the same upgrade discount multiple times in quick succession.\n  * Upgrade buttons are unavailable during the active cooldown period.\n  * Cooldown automatically resets upon level completion or losing.\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "383571e43bef0aca43cd3984a1039585d97f34e0", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/adsUpgradeCooldown", "head_sha": "9ecdc51faca08f3ebb237b63b5dbd792b4ea3bdd", "additions": 33, "deletions": 8, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2026-01-14T23:40:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T17:28:19Z", "merged_at": "2026-01-15T17:28:13Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-15T17:28:13Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/20", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#28", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 28, "title": "Main Menu Updates", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated ad timer icons, updated upgrade ad buttons\r\n\r\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"1242\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-16 145007\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f87894d-8fff-487a-928e-1101ceee2653\" />\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added skill screen background graphics in blue, red, and yellow theme variants\n  \n* **Updates**\n  * Enhanced ad button and pricing display functionality\n  * Updated and optimized UI icons with refined sizing for better performance\n\n* **Removals**\n  * Removed unused flag asset\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "1d259cdfa542d83513c93ca504dc0c3ac48e3cc1", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/mainMenuUpdates", "head_sha": "edb421631aabbcfa228efbbabd6536ea5d69b7cc", "additions": 932, "deletions": 619, "changed_files": 57, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2026-01-16T20:50:47Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T15:22:45Z", "merged_at": "2026-01-17T15:22:43Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-17T15:22:43Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/27", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#34", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 34, "title": "IAP", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * In\u2011game store with purchasable items, layouts and payouts (gems, tickets, special entitlements).\n  * New currencies: Gems and Tickets; ticket usage now funds rewarded flows.\n  * Purchaseable speed boost and permanent rotation; \"No Ads\" entitlement disables interstitials.\n  * Rewarded ad flows updated to prefer tickets when available and show appropriate UI (icons, timers, purchase popups).\n* **Chores**\n  * Billing mode/resource added for Android store configuration.\n\n<sub>\u270f\ufe0f Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "3a9fabf47339463eba248332c6d021ba5e01df12", "head_ref": "Blake/IAP", "head_sha": "775c88aad810b95bcd88f10e9ab2499e5b7c5979", "additions": 19601, "deletions": 171, "changed_files": 142, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:47:58Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-28T20:01:09Z", "merged_at": "2026-01-28T20:01:03Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-28T20:01:03Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/30", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters#37", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/Combo-Fighters", "number": 37, "title": "Combo Definition Updates", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated ComboDefinition\r\n- Created ComboRarityDefinition\r\n- Updated ComboScreen to handle new locked/special combo prefab\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added combo rarity tiers: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary, Mythic.\n  * New unlock mechanic with visible unlock cost and in\u2011UI purchase button for special combos.\n  * Combo leveling with configurable progression and persistent unlocks/levels saved between sessions.\n  * Updated UI: special combo cells, rarity visuals/backgrounds, and rarity data assets; editor tooling to populate rarity data.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "4e9e1e94d7d89fb7ef9985d1a6c271421129888a", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/comboDefUpdate", "head_sha": "bf4e630b9afd8147c7c86a6953a6a9e50cc3cf64", "additions": 653, "deletions": 37, "changed_files": 28, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2026-02-12T06:31:04Z", "updated_at": "2026-02-13T21:59:05Z", "merged_at": "2026-02-13T21:59:02Z", "closed_at": "2026-02-13T21:59:02Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/39", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#100", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 100, "title": "Refresh characters grid on CharactersSelect screen back button is pressed", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "4a4e10b8539b33ed5d1cb11afa254aa1a4eec7e6", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/characterselection", "head_sha": "47a6f68619693cb86c2af916cc93ca3dabc39fa2", "additions": 6, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0001_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2023-10-26T21:47:08Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-29T20:22:57Z", "merge