dation to check if NatesWinStreak progress controller reference is missing on WorldMapUI\r\n- Updated NatesWinStreakProgress to show remaining time rather than elapsed time\r\n\r\nFixes added from latest feedback from [PERSON_NAME_0040]:\r\n- Number of active players will decrease incrementally (90,80, 60 etc) or 92-88, 78-82 etc randomized numbers.\r\n- The players are needed to be taken to the island upon level win.\r\n- The ships need to move between islands.\r\n- Tokens on the islands to be removed.\r\n- Make the ship bigger, 7 avatars on it including the player avatar.\r\n- The event intro pop up to be shown automatically at session start based on the flow in Miro.", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "5062036994ca8f5d12f18c1fe5a5a93791b726d8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ENG-1871-1", "head_sha": "69a8338e519ed02b39eae593b6d22d220fd88f26", "additions": 5119, "deletions": 169890, "changed_files": 17, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-01-09T17:02:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-10T17:09:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-01-10T17:09:48Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-10T17:09:48Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/742", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1642", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1642, "title": "Fix for NatesWinStreak 146 error when attempting to increase event wins", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "8b2370bcc7bf80ce1199ec0d991078f6244597c9", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/natesWinStreakRequestErrors", "head_sha": "a4a724e0d13e2a74b21656ce8a5fb29fcd310f22", "additions": 57, "deletions": 27, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "re