: "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Replaced **InHandTilePile** with **_inHandTilePile**, because **InHandTilePile** do no longer have the correct amount of remaining tiles.", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "7623bb73404ea85dd48acd98e61b57dd6bc3847c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/smallFixes", "head_sha": "1536bbcd7773a37b75c057b87691867058ee973f", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0001_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2023-12-20T19:07:49Z", "updated_at": "2023-12-20T19:33:24Z", "merged_at": "2023-12-20T19:33:23Z", "closed_at": "2023-12-20T19:33:23Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/899", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1784", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1784, "title": "Localization Round 2", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "a0d90f65d12d5639bfd38131a059e36cc3a49cdd", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/localization", "head_sha": "b8cf058af5ba38d8c9b286181e568eb685156aa0", "additions": 186426, "deletions": 37878, "changed_files": 648, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-11T00:37:50Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-15T17:28:16Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-04-15T17:28:16Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/906", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1790", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1790, "title": "Fix for RiverRush 15 Min Infinite Lives granted on event started not saved after Level Completed", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Added missing PlayerData.Commit call to save 15 min InfiniteBoost on RiverRush Stage 1 start", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "f5bd2c356e377f22e22fe57512ef39115b0533ec", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/riverRush15MinInfiniteLivesFix", "head_sha": "922946527c8ab010ccf64e06c298b561a4cb13f6", "additions": 12, "deletions": 7, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-15T23:12:16Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-21T17:59:04Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-21T17:59:04Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-21T17:59:04Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/914", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1798", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1798, "title": "Font Reverts", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- When adding Localize component to GameObjects that needed translation (either displaying missing characters or not displaying a translation at all), the I2Localize changed font type on the TextMesh component to the one used for the language we were testing on. That means there were some default fonts replaced with NotoSansKR, NotoSansJP and others.\r\n\r\nThis PR is the first step of reverting back to our default fonts.", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "c5881dfbfac5112fddea50233b7fb5f60cd3ad79", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/fontReverts", "head_sha": "2050ebb6a5b36114bb5f5bf3f00c363bee8e7763", "additions": 47, "deletions": 64, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-24T00:56:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-24T01:02:43Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-24T01:02:43Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-24T01:02:43Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/917", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#180", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 180, "title": "MINIGAMES now reward properly", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Conveyor Belt:\r\n- Updated ConveyorBeltManager tile coin awarded value from 5 to 1 (According to https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit?pli=1#gid=611930899)\r\n- Updated RewardManager to award 1 live every 2 hours (According to https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit?pli=1#gid=611930899)\r\n- Updated ConveyorBelt RewardPanel to show correct coins and correct lives awarded\r\n\r\nMemory Game:\r\n- Updated MemoryGameManager coins reward to 40, 80, 120 for easy, medium and hard (According to [PERSON_NAME_0054] hehe)\r\n- Updated RewardMemoryGame to award 1 live every 1 hour, 1.5 hours and 2 hours for easy, medium and hard (According to https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit?pli=1#gid=611930899)\r\n- Updated RewardPanel on MemoryGame scene to show correct coins and correct lives awarded", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "f93aaebd7de8e75d3284c27af3d78229e8d10447", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/smallFixes", "head_sha": "f24b98c8af3f3a731d87f6b2f5be21a7127f2cf8", "additions": 83, "deletions": 22, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0001_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2023-12-20T23:38:13Z", "updated_at": "2023-12-21T15:59:23Z", "merged_at": "2023-12-21T15:59:22Z", "closed_at": "2023-12-21T15:59:22Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/918", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1800", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1800, "title": "Font Reverts", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- When adding Localize component to GameObjects that needed translation (either displaying missing characters or not displaying a translation at all), the I2Localize changed font type on the TextMesh component to the one used for the language we were testing on. That means there were some default fonts replaced with NotoSansKR, NotoSansJP and others.\r\n\r\nThis PR covers all WorldMap and Board related.", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "cb4aeb93d28c4bbed6a0c15526156f2f68dd390e", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/fontReverts2", "head_sha": "260ed86355bcebf1c11893fd83a028906a172813", "additions": 368, "deletions": 549, "changed_files": 21, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-24T05:03:38Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-24T05:04:12Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-24T05:04:12Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-24T05:04:12Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/921", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1803", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1803, "title": "More Localization fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Finished reverting texts to use the correct font assets\r\n- Added code to restart and reset app on language change to prevent inconsistent behavior\r\n- Updated ChooseLanguage.cs to fix Quests not refreshing on language change (Still having issues with FTUE ones)\r\n- Reimported localization spreadsheet\r\n- Removed Arabic, Hebrew and Traditional Chinese references from the game\r\n- Updated new font assets addressable groups to not be included in build but being downloaded via addresables on demand (I think this will make [PERSON_NAME_0050] phone to not crash frequently)\r\n- Set MultiLang font for French and Turkish to fix consistency issues due to missing characters and fallback font assets\r\n", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "2644bf207ca226771f76c142d694e6d3c9ad7e55", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/moreLocalization", "head_sha": "ec68fef552046c0a47012bfb6c1f11484a4e2844", "additions": 203, "deletions": 170, "changed_files": 16, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-24T23:33:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-25T00:34:26Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-25T00:34:26Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-25T00:34:26Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/926", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1808", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1808, "title": "More Localization Fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Enabled RiverRush tap anywhere localize component\r\n- Updated QuestAPI, MissioQuest, ChooseLanguage and DominoPlayerPrefs to better handling quest description refresh on language changed\r\n- Updated QuestDetail description text to switch fonts on language changed\r\n- Updated Settings choose language to load flags from addressables\r\n", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "7ebf841877f5492b3051ca5150eb4db5d22b6315", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/moremorelocalization", "head_sha": "50747b7e4e99f688ec80362f3b4b61ad3b5daea0", "additions": 143, "deletions": 76, "changed_files": 18, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-25T23:05:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-26T17:50:17Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-26T17:50:17Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-26T17:50:17Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/930", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1811", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1811, "title": "Fixed lives timer localize", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "ab7672411760bb7548ea58e5193ea9a3390c3c7a", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/timerlocalize", "head_sha": "4bfb67ede3cbab011411e8df08d6e3d394fb2bda", "additions": 6, "deletions": 17, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-26T22:12:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-26T22:38:09Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-26T22:38:09Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-26T22:38:09Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/934", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1815", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1815, "title": "Fix for Retry prelevel dialogue bugs", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "