ated PlayerData to add locked characters to HeroCollection to keep track of shards collected\r\n- Updated UnlockCharacter to update locked state instead of adding to hero collection\r\n- Updated Characters list and Characters profile controllers to handle new locked state\r\n- Fixed isUnlockable and isUpgradable status on Character screen controllers", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "d40a3bd8c3918bec8102379256e94e775c8cfa6e", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/smallFixes", "head_sha": "6d4acd539cd772be53556feba288d1e5a6c3f0cf", "additions": 34, "deletions": 20, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0001_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2023-12-23T00:13:19Z", "updated_at": "2023-12-23T00:22:20Z", "merged_at": "2023-12-23T00:22:20Z", "closed_at": "2023-12-23T00:22:20Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/1066", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#209", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 209, "title": "Character Profile Update: Skills and Streak Rewards", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Fixed CharactersProfileController not updating Upgraded/Unlocked hero info\r\n- Created CharacterStreakSkillRewardItem controller and prefab to display character skills and streak rewards\r\n- Updated SkillDefinition to make reward amount accessible.", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "e12d1ffb5ce841544710fb217a03b9fb7bda4df5", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/smallFixes", "head_sha": "c8497a885e6a68ed2e7daefa4ba6e384f9d2edfb", "additions": 11202, "deletions": 9008, "changed_files": 9, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAM