 I update the current OnStreakRewardAchieved to send StreakNumber as parameter.\r\n- If you want to do something when player achieved 5 streak, just use the same OnStreakRewardAchieved and set StreakNumber parameter to 5. Check StreakBar_v2.tutorial for usage.", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "c0ecac3a5532f460a06bfc729b4e44f29616d043", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/tutorialStreakEventUpdate", "head_sha": "6a5eee629e43f15241fe7e571836fe4fde3b7d84", "additions": 35, "deletions": 12, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-04-18T07:49:15Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T12:35:51Z", "merged_at": "2024-04-18T12:35:51Z", "closed_at": "2024-04-18T12:35:51Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/1454", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#559", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 559, "title": "ENG-747: Add tool tip when players click on a locked feature", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated TutorialManager LockUI to show tooltip on locked navigation buttons", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "42fafaa6eed2cd1105c422410ab16b7279bd38f1", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ENG747", "head_sha": "99f0f671f106d178fdb579f5172b634ba50d5e0e", "additions": 664, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-04-19T16:54:40Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-19T17:54:51Z", "merged_at": "2024-04-19T17:54:50Z", "closed_at": "2024-04-19T17:54:50Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/1458", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "rec