 upgrading characters\r\n\r\nThe new coin cost is here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit?gid=855125093#gid=855125093\r\n\r\nColumn D \r\n\r\n2- We'll turn off gaining coins from the remaining from the remaining tiles. When Marcus comes we'll swap tiles turning into coins animations into tiles turning into tiledozer/plinko tokens animations. For now let's also turn off the \"turning into coins animations into tiles\" animation\r\n\r\nThe new payout table is here under \"Baklava coin payout by level\" tab: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit?gid=1618028454#gid=1618028454", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "18da5c636099164848121b5854c6d070cc2651ff", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ENG-1287", "head_sha": "d95dd3d09a362ef54a899608d0c1292d0adbc9fc", "additions": 10, "deletions": 14, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-09-07T00:19:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-07T16:43:04Z", "merged_at": "2024-09-07T16:43:04Z", "closed_at": "2024-09-07T16:43:04Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/1921", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#98", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 98, "title": "New Character Select", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Notes:\r\n\r\n- Characters screen (grid) is still using the old images that were on previous UI\r\n- Character sprite does not change on Characters Select screen, added a RawTexture that we can use when we get the new Sophie materials with lighting\r\n- Shards, stars and upgradeability not set up yet. If anyone knows if available in client, let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n![characters](https://github.com/harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes/assets/798702/7d7e545f-57bd-4892-b7cc-3e9e1361ca1f)\r\n![charactersSelect](https://github.com/harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes/assets/798702/613f3c34-0c12-424c-bb31-79f9db649c96)\r\n", "base_ref": "master", "base_sha": "1f68538436bdb56fdedbc953f6b7e6782dd8e21f", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/characterselection", "head_sha": "aea7b4ea2057a7c48f880d80564e56dbadbbc42f", "additions": 574800, "deletions": 152752, "changed_files": 215, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0001_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2023-10-26T17:30:25Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-26T18:11:56Z", "merged_at": "2023-10-26T18:11:56Z", "closed_at": "2023-10-26T18:11:56Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/1934", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#991", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 991, "title": "Fire and Key symbol fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Fixed Domino prefab side indexes to point to correct symbol\r\n- Fixed DominoSide.Markings enum values\r\n- Updated default symbol replace limit on DominoGameManager\r\n- Updated chapter 3 bomb levels symbol replace limit to guarantee fire symbol always show on bomb tile levels", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "bc6c5a727bddd90d9ee9cadd1ac635c15dbaae71", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/fireAndKeySymbolFixes", "head_sha": "09f203dba41a0b5886f7fb94df6790f85ece37df", "additions": 47, "deletions": 47, "changed_files": 14, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-09-09T19:09:40Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-10T16:55:23Z", "merge